  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Chen Yi activates karma divine tree while Fairy Zi Wei attacks. Immortal killer move Dead Inside From Sorrow is named. The emotion of sorrow spreads quickly. There are no bright lights from the method, yet many of the variant human Gu Immortals defending Lang Ya land spirit twitch, grasp their hearts, roll their eyes, and die mysteriously. Sixth Hair, already near death after Thunder Ghost True Monarch’s explosion, dies to this attack.",
      "chapters": [
        1582
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chen_yi",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "char_sixth_hair",
        "char_thunder_ghost_true_monarch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan is unharmed, but Reverse Flow River loses another ten percent of its water. That puts the offensive killer move on par with Thunder Ghost True Monarch’s final self-detonated explosion.",
      "chapters": [
        1582
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_reverse_flow_river"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit grabs Fang Yuan’s arm and uses a defensive killer move. Reverse flow protection seal can protect only Fang Yuan. The land spirit’s defenses break. His body shatters into shards, and he dies on the spot, disintegrating.",
      "chapters": [
        1582
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei relaxes until she almost faints. Dead inside from sorrow has great backlash. After using it this time, she would have to rest for a very long time.",
      "chapters": [
        1582
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A second Lang Ya land spirit appears, the white haired one. Fairy Zi Wei knew of that secret and was confident that dead inside from sorrow could kill both land spirits together. Lang Ya blessed land is more profound than her estimate. She could use the killer move again, but there is no time, and ordinary methods cannot kill the land spirit while Fang Yuan defends him.",
      "chapters": [
        1582
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
